&#x27;re still managing inventory in spreadsheets, you&#x27;re flying blind.</p><div class="pg-hero__cta"><a href="pricing.php" class="gradient-bg shadow-btn pg-btn">Get Started Free<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-3 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="pg-btn pg-btn--ghost" href="software.php">Back to Software</a></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-4xl"><div class="pg-sec__head"><h2 class="pg-h2">2026 Inventory Challenges for Resellers</h2><p class="pg-sec__sub">Amazon policy changes in early 2026 require immediate action. Understand the challenge. Get ahead.</p></div><div class="pgx-141"><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pg-card__title">FBA Prep Discontinued (Jan 1, 2026)</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Amazon no longer labels, poly-bags, or preps your inventory. You need a 3PL or handle prep yourself. Ecom Circles integrates with warehouse services for FBA prep, so you upload inventory and it&#x27;s ready for shipment.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pg-card__title">Commingling Ending (March 31, 2026)</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Stickerless/shared inventory pools are gone. Every unit needs YOUR FNSKU. If you don&#x27;t track which units are labeled, you&#x27;ll get stranded inventory locked at FBA. Ecom Circles flags unlabeled units before the deadline.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pg-card__title">FBA Fee Increases (Jan 2026)</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Storage fees are now $0.78/cu ft standard, $2.40/cu ft peak. Returns processing fee added. COGS tracking must include these costs or your margin calculations are wrong. Ecom Circles includes all 2026 rates.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pg-card__title">Multi-Channel Overselling</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Sell 50 units on Amazon AND Walmart without inventory sync, and both can sell simultaneously. Overselling causes penalties, cancelled orders, and lost trust. Automatic sync prevents this entirely.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="features" class="pg-sec pg-sec--base bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-5xl"><div class="pg-sec__head"><h2 class="pg-h2">Complete Inventory Management Suite</h2><p class="pg-sec__sub">Eight essential features built for multi-channel sellers managing FBA, FBM, Walmart, and Mirakl.</p></div><div class="pgx-28"><div class="pg-card pg-card--alt"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-55 lucide lucide-package" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7"></polyline><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">Multi-Channel Stock Tracking</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Track inventory across Amazon (FBA + FBM), Walmart (WFS + seller-fulfilled), and Mirakl. One SKU, multiple channels, automatic sync.</p></div><div class="pg-card pg-card--alt"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-55 lucide lucide-database" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">COGS &amp; True Profitability</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Track cost basis per SKU including wholesale price, shipping, prep costs, and FBA fees. Know your true margin before you list.</p></div>