></path></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">MAP Enforcement</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Set Minimum Advertised Price per product. Blocks repricing below MAP automatically. Essential for brand-authorized wholesale.</p></div><div class="pg-card pg-card--alt"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-55 lucide lucide-database" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">FBA Shipment Planning</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Calculate how many units to send to FBA based on velocity, storage costs, and restock limits. Avoid long-term storage fees.</p></div><div class="pg-card pg-card--alt"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-55 lucide lucide-circle-alert" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">Stranded Inventory Detection</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Flags inventory at FBA that isn&#x27;t linked to an active listing. With commingling ending, stranded inventory risk is critical.</p></div><div class="pg-card pg-card--alt"><div class="pg-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-55 lucide lucide-refresh-cw" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="pg-card__title">FNSKU Label Tracking</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Track labeled vs. unlabeled inventory before the March 31, 2026 commingling deadline. Prevents stranded inventory at FBA.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--base bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Inventory in Your Workflow</h2><div class="pgx-10"><p>Inventory management is the hub of your operation. <a class="pg-link" href="order-management.php">Sync with orders</a> to prevent overselling across channels, then <a class="pg-link" href="repricer.php">reprice by inventory level</a> to optimize pricing based on stock. Coordinate with <a class="pg-link" href="amazon-management.php">inventory in management</a> services to track FBA prep and fulfillment compliance.</p><p>For warehouse and dropshipping operations, <a class="pg-link" href="warehouse.php">warehouse inventory tracking</a> ensures your 3PL stock levels stay synchronized, and <a class="pg-link" href="two-step-dropshipping.php">track dropshipped inventory</a> across your fulfillment pipeline.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Why Inventory Management Matters</h2><div class="pgx-11"><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Wholesale Seller with 3 Suppliers</h3><p class="pgx-13">Each supplier uses different SKU formats. Without centralized inventory, you&#x27;re reconciling 3 spreadsheets daily. One mistake and your supplier costs are wrong.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Multi-Channel Seller (Amazon + Walmart)</h3><p class="pgx-13">Walmart&#x27;s algorithm deprioritizes listings that go out of stock. One stockout costs you weeks of organic ranking recovery. Automatic sync keeps both channels in stock.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">RA Seller Scaling Past 500 SKUs</h3><p class="pgx-13">At this volume, manual COGS tracking breaks. You think you&#x27;re making 25% margins but after FBA fees, storage, and prep costs, you&#x27;re at 8%. Ecom Circles shows the true number.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--base bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Ecom Circles vs. Spreadsheets</h2><div class="pgx-143"><div><h3 class="pgx-12">vs. Spreadsheets</h3><p class="pgx-144">No automatic sync. Error-prone. Can&#x27;t handle multi-channel. No alerts. Manual updates kill productivity.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">vs. Forecast-Only Tools</h3><p class="pgx-144">Some tools focus only on forecasting and planning inventory buys. Ecom Circles is built for resellers managing COGS and multi-channel sync across Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl, the operational layer you need daily.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Real-World Impact</h2><div class="pgx-10"><p>Multi-channel sellers using Ecom Circles inventory management report:</p><ul class="pgx-124"><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-145">✓</span><span><strong>Zero overselling incidents.</strong> Inventory syncs automatically across all channels.</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-145">✓</span><span><strong>5-10 hours/week saved.</strong> No more manual inventory updates across spreadsheets.</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-145">✓</span><span><strong>2-3% margin improvement.</strong> COGS tracking prevents underpricing.</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-145">✓</span><span><strong>Faster 3PL coordination.</strong> Warehouse syncs automatically, no daily calls.</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-145">✓</span><span><strong>Smooth 2026 transition.</strong> Ecom Circles inventory management helps you track FNSKU labeling status and flag units that need attention before the March 31 commingling deadline.</span></li></ul><p class="pgx-146">$1.7B+ in total sales volume processed. 5.15M list